# Fingerstyle: p i m a m i in 3/4 (repertoire plan: st-pimami-3-4). An original study in the
# manner of the 19th-century guitar methods. Thumb (p) on the bass: string 5 for Am, 4 for Dm,
# 6 for E; i, m and a on strings 3, 2 and 1. Bars 9-16: the thumb and a pluck together on
# beat 1 (a pinch), and the a note is the tune: E F G# E, then G F E.
title: Fingerstyle: p i m a m i in 3/4
id: st-pimami-3-4
composer: Sixstring Academy
source: Original study for the right hand, in the classical style
licence: Original study for Sixstring Academy
difficulty: 4
tags: classical, fingerstyle, arpeggios, waltz time
tempo: 66
time: 3/4
key: A minor

